    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111779" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλῐδάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overflow with moisture, be ready to burst,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συὸς φλιδόωντος ἀλοιφῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					557
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σηπεδόσι φλιδόωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					363
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς δέρμασι φ. καὶ ῥακοῦσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.642e
				</span></i>
			.—<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> also has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλιδάνει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπίπτει, διαρρεῖ,</span></div>
